<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 21px;"><em>"Education is the most powerful weapon </em></span></p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 21px;"><em>which you can use </em></span><span style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 21px;"><em>to change the world"</em></span></p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 21px;">-&nbsp;Nelson Mandela</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">During these moments of uncertainty in higher education, we must remember our why. We have the ability to change the world and the future, one student at a time. Your friends at Flywire stand with you and are committed to supporting you and your institution in 2025 and beyond!</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Here's a sneak peak of what's to come this year from Flywire, how you can stay connected, and new resources to help keep the learning going!</p> </td> 
</tr> 
