<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Mark your calendars! We're excited to announce that our annual U.S. Education Client Conference &amp; Awards Ceremony, <a style="color: #223341;" href="http://www.flywire.com/fusion?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q4clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Flywire Fusion</u></strong></span></a>, will be returning in 2025. This year's event will take place in historic Leesburg, Virginia - just outside Washington, DC! </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Last year, we brought together higher ed's leading innovators, and this year, we're turning up the energy even more. Bigger conversations, bolder impact, and even more transformation! Join us <strong>October 20th to the 22nd at the Lansdowne Resort</strong> and get ready to connect, collaborate, innovate, and inspire.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Want to be part of our Fusion agenda? Submit your speaking proposal ideas today using <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfWs23p8wlepifeqdWltQrRwZhODdIAlU4Sxh3VmCDlTEQBCg/viewform?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q4clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>this form</u></strong></span></a>.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
