<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #edf4fa;">Discover how GradGuard’s Tuition Protection Program, now integrated with Flywire’s Student Financial Software (SFS) solution, helps leading colleges and universities increase student confidence while getting paid, in full, for account balances when a student withdraws for a covered reason.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #edf4fa;">Flywire's Brett Cassell will be joined by Derrick Shy, VP of Campus Development at <strong>GradGuard</strong> to discuss the integration and walk attendees through a demo. Hear first-hand from Heather Clang, Bursar at <strong>Wentworth Institute of Technology</strong>, how institutions are benefiting from this offering. Join us for this live discussion on <strong>February 27th at 2 PM ET</strong>.&nbsp;</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
